 price@price.demon.co.uk  (Michael Clive Price) writes in X-Message-Number: #94-7-168:
>>  Based on my experience with neural nets, I don't believe that
>> learning rules scale up tractably.   [...]
>
>Just to clarify.  I assume you are referring to the time it takes for
